stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IdleFullSession : Start fresh session (held from 0)

    IdleFullSession --> TurnRunning : User sends prompt
    TurnRunning --> TurnRunning : Tool opens, changes, or finishes
    TurnRunning --> TurnRunning : Mid-turn compaction (keeps all blocks)
    TurnRunning --> IdleFullSession : Turn ends (keeps all blocks)
    IdleFullSession --> IdleFullSession : Compaction between turns (keeps all blocks)

    IdleFullSession --> ReprintingSession : Terminal resizes (reprints 0..end)
    TurnRunning --> ReprintingSession : Terminal resizes (reprints 0..end)
    ReprintingSession --> IdleFullSession : Reprint finishes (turn closed)
    ReprintingSession --> TurnRunning : Reprint finishes (turn open)

    IdleFullSession --> CtrlOInMemory : Open Ctrl+O (reads 0..end from memory)
    TurnRunning --> CtrlOInMemory : Open Ctrl+O (reads 0..end from memory)
    CtrlOInMemory --> CtrlOInMemory : PageUp / PageDown inside memory
    CtrlOInMemory --> IdleFullSession : Close Ctrl+O

    IdleFullSession --> IdleFullSession : /new or /clear drops old session
    TurnRunning --> IdleFullSession : /new or /clear drops old session
    IdleFullSession --> Crashed : Process crashes
    TurnRunning --> Crashed : Process crashes
    Crashed --> ResumedCycle : Restart (--resume from last cycle)
    IdleFullSession --> ResumedCycle : /new or /clear then /resume

    ResumedCycle --> ResumedCycle : Compactions keep resumed cycle..end
    ResumedCycle --> CtrlOReadingLog : Open Ctrl+O and scroll past resumed start
    CtrlOReadingLog --> CtrlOReadingLog : Log read completes or fails
    CtrlOReadingLog --> ResumedCycle : Close Ctrl+O

    note right of IdleFullSession
        Rule breaks caught by planted bugs:
        - Drop on turn end breaks NoDropDuringSession
        - Compaction advances held start breaks HeldIsCurrentSession / CompactionKeepsHistory
        - Clear without drop breaks OldSessionDroppedOnChange
        - Live drop breaks LiveNeverDropped
    end note
